			templ_7745c5c3_Err = templruntime.WriteString(templ_7745c5c3_Buffer, 12, " <section class=\"card help\" id=\"phone\"><h2>Add things from your phone</h2><p>Wishbone installs onto a phone's home screen and opens without browser chrome around it. Then, from any shop's app or website, you can share a product straight to it.</p><h3 id=\"install\">Install it</h3><ul><li><strong>Android, in Chrome:</strong> open Wishbone, then the &vellip; menu &rarr; <em>Add to Home screen</em>. Accept the prompt if you get one instead.</li><li><strong>iPhone, in Safari:</strong> open Wishbone, tap Share, then <em>Add to Home Screen</em>. It has to be Safari — Chrome on an iPhone cannot install web apps.</li></ul><p>Sign in once afterwards. A signed-in session lasts about a month and renews as you use it, so in practice you sign in a couple of times a year.</p><h3 id=\"share-android\">Sharing from Android</h3><p>Nothing to set up. Share a product page from any app and pick <strong>")
