			templ_7745c5c3_Err = templruntime.WriteString(templ_7745c5c3_Buffer, 13, "</strong> in the share sheet. It opens the add-item form with the link already in place.</p><p>If Wishbone is not offered in the sheet, open the installed app once and try again — Android only registers it after a first launch.</p><h3 id=\"share-iphone\">Sharing from an iPhone</h3><p>Safari has no way to offer Wishbone in the share sheet by itself, so an iPhone needs a Shortcut. It takes about two minutes, once per phone:</p><ol><li>Open the <strong>Shortcuts</strong> app, tap <strong>+</strong>, and name it <em>Add to Wishbone</em>.</li><li>Tap the ⓘ at the bottom, turn on <strong>Show in Share Sheet</strong>, and under <em>Share Sheet Types</em> leave only <strong>URLs</strong> and <strong>Safari web pages</strong>.</li><li>Add the action <strong>Open URLs</strong>.</li><li>Set the URL to this, then put the <strong>Shortcut Input</strong> variable on the end of it:<p class=\"help-code\"><code>")
